# GitHub requests a review from these owners automatically. The list mirrors the
# paths where .claude/approvals.yml asks for a second person, so a routine pull
# request, which Claude can approve, requests nobody.
# One exception CODEOWNERS cannot express: a Renovate-only workflow update needs
# nobody when Claude's review passes, but still requests the team here.
# Keep this file and the two-person rules in .claude/approvals.yml in step.
# "Require review from Code Owners" is on: GitHub requires a code owner on these
# paths. Keep routine paths out of this file, or Claude's approval stops being enough.

# Review rules and agent instructions
.claude/ @Topsort/integrations
REVIEW.md @Topsort/integrations
/.agents/ @Topsort/integrations
/.cursor/ @Topsort/integrations
/docs/agents/ @Topsort/integrations
AGENTS.md @Topsort/integrations
CLAUDE.md @Topsort/integrations
CLAUDE.local.md @Topsort/integrations
.claudeignore @Topsort/integrations
.cursorignore @Topsort/integrations
.mcp.json @Topsort/integrations

# Who reviews, CI and dependency automation
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Topsort/integrations
/.github/workflows/ @Topsort/integrations
/.github/renovate.json* @Topsort/integrations
/renovate.json* @Topsort/integrations
/.renovaterc* @Topsort/integrations

# Build pipeline
buildspec.yml @Topsort/integrations
build.sh @Topsort/integrations
